{"title":"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 27","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_27\">Problem 27</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 27\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There is more than one integer greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> which, when divided by any integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/1/6b138450031dc4cfaa69c03f4e37d23c26d549b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\le k \\le 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"84\" height=\"15\" />, has a remainder of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. \nWhat is the difference between the two smallest such integers?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/c/32c753f17a81402eb4dfcfee9b42fba9f97154b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }2310\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }2311\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }27,720\\qquad \\textbf{(D) }27,721\\qquad  \\textbf{(E) }\\text{none of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"583\" height=\"17\" />  \n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let this integer be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />. We have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/c/e0cc096674818fab2d9accd4261e23fe6c22338e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n\\equiv 1 \\mod 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"106\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/6/4a6b3fc219bc21b3ef07ca72b2011139b920e920.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\equiv 1 \\mod 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"106\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/0/3405c65f536dd63674245c4fbe706d8c326130bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\equiv 1 \\mod 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"106\" height=\"13\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/5/3958e984d2597b35da7975f4503cdcf965a777f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\ldots$\" width=\"19\" height=\"2\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/d/45d5bd3366f9fa5ded530f19996b86f3c2a748ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\equiv 1 \\mod 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"114\" height=\"13\" />.\nRecall that if \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/0/92040e049af2ad01f92d7552e97019ca8cd514d8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a \\equiv b \\mod c\\]\" width=\"108\" height=\"12\" />\nand <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/9/4493f649d73f21671d93a8360024154476126c33.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a \\equiv b \\mod d\\]\" width=\"109\" height=\"12\" />\nthen <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/5/bb5b70421bea155d1a77ea62c80e9abb92284174.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a \\equiv b \\mod (lcm (c,d))\\]\" width=\"182\" height=\"18\" />\nWe see that since\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/c/e0cc096674818fab2d9accd4261e23fe6c22338e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n\\equiv 1 \\mod 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"106\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/6/4a6b3fc219bc21b3ef07ca72b2011139b920e920.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\equiv 1 \\mod 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"106\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/0/3405c65f536dd63674245c4fbe706d8c326130bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\equiv 1 \\mod 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"106\" height=\"13\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/5/3958e984d2597b35da7975f4503cdcf965a777f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\ldots$\" width=\"19\" height=\"2\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/d/45d5bd3366f9fa5ded530f19996b86f3c2a748ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\equiv 1 \\mod 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"114\" height=\"13\" />.\nWe have \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/3/28359ba8eefc6250b31e8fa8e06a240b454ffdd2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[n \\equiv 1 \\mod (lcm (2, 3, \\ldots , 10, 11))\\]\" width=\"270\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>From <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> contains the largest power of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> contains the largest power of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> contains the largest power of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Thus, our lcm is equal to\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/9/269ea7a58b814060210fb64ff8ff11d053e3f76a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2^3 \\cdot 3^2 \\cdot 5 \\cdot 7 \\cdot 11\\]\" width=\"120\" height=\"15\" />\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/d/49d98ffe996c0f0d3b82b284cba2113439fefea9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n &gt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"46\" height=\"15\" />, our <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> smallest values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> are \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/e/1ee02a6e4fe69e18b7df5f54dd6112a05fb21e59.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[n = 1 + (2^3 \\cdot 3^2 \\cdot 5 \\cdot 7 \\cdot 11)\\]\" width=\"200\" height=\"19\" /> \nand\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/4/b94095311ed8731642d94f2793a933829805974e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[n = 1 + 2(2^3 \\cdot 3^2 \\cdot 5 \\cdot 7 \\cdot 11)\\]\" width=\"209\" height=\"19\" />\nThe difference between these values is simply the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/f/7dfb929c6da415930f8e9f3690ea4e14f706ef0b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(2^3 \\cdot 3^2 \\cdot 5 \\cdot 7 \\cdot 11) = 40 \\cdot 99 \\cdot 7\\]\" width=\"230\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/8/2c8fac7b072f3f2ebc5a6d67ac7a3d5ac3ddaeb2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[= 3960 \\cdot 7\\]\" width=\"76\" height=\"12\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/9/c3982faa1502e27735c853153f15eb31bbc103e9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[= 27720, \\boxed{C}\\]\" width=\"97\" height=\"24\" />\n</p><p>~JustinLee2017\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME\" title=\"1978 AHSME\">1978 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1978 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1978\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">Problem 26</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=